Sentence scripts
----------------
The sentence texts in text/ were generated with LLM assistance, imported,
deduplicated and human-reviewed by the authors. They contain no third-party
text. The generator and date are recorded in the source candidate files where
available; the published manifests do not carry per-row generator metadata.

No model weights
----------------
This dataset contains no Whisper, Silero or Moth model weights. The companion
model is distributed separately at:
https://huggingface.co/semantique-team/moth-stt

